1
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,640
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:12,710
=Episode 20=

3
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:15,720
(That wretch slipped away again!)

4
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:28,480
Your Highness.

5
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,000
Lately,

6
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:31,320
Consort Rong and Concubine Rou

7
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,520
have been meeting quite often.

8
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:33,880
Just this morning,

9
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,960
Concubine Rou went to
Jinghe Palace again.

10
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:36,920
I'm worried

11
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,880
they're plotting against you.

12
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,120
Those two wretches.

13
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,400
They must spend every waking moment

14
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:46,280
thinking of ways to bring me down.

15
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,400
You have the late Empress's protection,

16
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:51,080
and the eldest prince as your shield.

17
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:53,040
No matter how hard they try,

18
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,760
His Majesty won't believe them easily.

19
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:59,720
The late Empress died when
His Majesty loved her most.

20
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:02,360
What you can't have is always the best.

21
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:05,960
The deeper his guilt and
longing for her,

22
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:07,760
the safer I am.

23
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:10,360
As long as I don't rebel,

24
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,200
or attempt regicide,

25
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:13,760
or leave evidence against me,

26
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:16,000
I can live in this harem

27
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:18,200
without a care in the world.

28
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,600
Exactly, Your Highness.

29
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:20,960
Once the chance arises,

30
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:22,920
you'll surely reclaim the Empress's seal

31
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:25,000
and regain control of the harem.

32
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,560
It's only a matter of time.

33
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:29,240
I want far more than that.

34
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:32,080
Back then, I deliberately burned incense

35
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:33,640
laced with drugs

36
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:36,040
to give the eldest prince nightmares,

37
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,840
so he'd depend on my care.

38
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:40,320
Now he's been installed
as heir to the throne.

39
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,680
My position

40
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:43,600
is more secure than ever.

41
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:45,680
The throne of Empress

42
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,880
will be mine sooner or later.

43
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,040
Your Highness.

44
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,920
You'll surely get what you wish for.

45
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:55,160
The tenth anniversary of
the late Empress's passing is days away.

46
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:59,080
I must seize this opportunity

47
00:01:59,520 --> 00:02:00,960
to deal with them once and for all.

48
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,000
Your Majesty.

49
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:08,320
Greetings, Your Majesty.

50
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:11,240
You must be tired
from reviewing the memorials.

51
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:13,560
Please have some ginseng soup
to refresh yourself.

52
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,440
Thank you, Consort Qi.

53
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:24,520
Your Majesty.

54
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:27,040
The late Empress's tenth memorial
is approaching.

55
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,760
The Ministry of Rites
drafted the arrangements,

56
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:31,200
and the Imperial Household
has submitted its supply list.

57
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:33,920
Though I no longer oversee the harem,

58
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:36,520
I used to arrange the memorial rites.

59
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:38,520
I asked a few questions this year,

60
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,720
not daring to decide alone.

61
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:42,120
So I've come to seek
Your Majesty's guidance.

62
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,000
It's been ten years,

63
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,040
yet you still care so deeply

64
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,240
about the late Empress.

65
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,520
I have committed offenses.

66
00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:52,080
It's not proper for me to lead.

67
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,560
But the memorial can't be delayed.

68
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,040
Your Majesty.

69
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,680
Could Consort Rong

70
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,080
organize this year's memorial?

71
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:02,240
She seems capable and efficient.

72
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,560
Consort Rong?

73
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:04,600
Exactly.

74
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,480
She's thoughtful

75
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,680
and thorough in her work.

76
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:09,280
If she leads it,

77
00:03:09,440 --> 00:03:11,560
things should go smoothly.

78
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:13,480
Hearing you say that

79
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,880
is rare indeed.

80
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,400
I've repented my mistakes.

81
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,160
And I know

82
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,960
the late Empress would wish

83
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:23,160
to see harmony in the harem,

84
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,600
with us united as sisters.

85
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:27,160
Consort Rong and I may have our rift,

86
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,600
but this memorial is a matter of state.

87
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:31,800
I won't let personal feelings interfere.

88
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,680
I'll do all I can to help her

89
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,880
make the memorial a success.

90
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:35,920
Good.

91
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,800
As for harem matters,

92
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:39,360
you think more carefully than I do.

93
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:40,840
Do it your way.

94
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:43,920
I thank Your Majesty
on the late Empress's behalf.

95
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:45,840
I shall take my leave.

96
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,439
(Jinghe Palace)

97
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,320
Put it down.

98
00:03:58,760 --> 00:03:59,480
Your Highness.

99
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,840
These are from the Imperial Household,

100
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,760
sent for Your Highness to review.

101
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:07,040
Careful!

102
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,080
Break anything, and you'll pay for it!

103
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,360
Please look these over, Your Highness.

104
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:14,080
I'll bring the rest.

105
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,320
What's the occasion today?

106
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,720
The Imperial Household
has sent so much over.

107
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,520
Could it be

108
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,160
a reward from His Majesty?

109
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,240
They didn't say it was a reward.

110
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Let's ask them later.

111
00:04:32,843 --> 00:04:33,879
(Auspicious Cranes
Bringing Good Fortune)

112
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:36,720
Why are these paintings and calligraphy
unsigned?

113
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,800
I heard

114
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:42,040
His Majesty has a fine collection
of famous works.

115
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,600
Could these be

116
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,800
palace treasures?

117
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,640
If you ask me,

118
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,920
the brushwork is rather stiff,

119
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,320
and the strokes lack subtlety.

120
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:53,120
Technically neat,

121
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,760
but short on spirit.

122
00:04:55,280 --> 00:04:56,440
Quite mediocre.

123
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,480
Then they can't be treasures.

124
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:09,760
Your Majesty.

125
00:05:10,400 --> 00:05:11,240
Please calm down.

126
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,280
Consort Rong entered the palace late.

127
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,600
She didn't know those were
the late Empress's works.

128
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:16,960
She meant no offense.

129
00:05:17,160 --> 00:05:18,440
I know Consort Rong

130
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,400
is skilled at painting.

131
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:20,720
But

132
00:05:21,720 --> 00:05:23,160
I had those paintings sent to her,

133
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,600
and she thinks so little of them?

134
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:27,440
Consort Rong can be rather proud,

135
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:30,320
but ignorance is no crime, Your Majesty.

136
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:33,200
Or should we have someone else

137
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,760
handle the memorial?

138
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:35,600
No need.

139
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,960
I'll leave it to her.

140
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:40,040
Let's see if she can do it properly.

141
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:41,440
Yes.

142
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,480
Put it down.

143
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,000
Your Highness.

144
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,120
I deserve death.

145
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,240
I was so busy just now

146
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,600
that I forgot to tell you.

147
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:02,440
These paintings were done by
the late Empress.

148
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:04,120
His Majesty has appointed you

149
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,640
to lead her tenth memorial.

150
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,280
The Imperial Household sent these over

151
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:09,560
for you to review and arrange
beforehand.

152
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,360
So these are the late Empress's works.

153
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,840
This is the lovers' knot
for the memorial.

154
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:20,080
This knot

155
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:22,640
was the token of love
at the Imperial wedding.

156
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:23,920
Please keep it safe.

157
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:26,400
It must be placed before
her spirit tablet on the day.

158
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:28,680
Understood.

159
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:29,840
Thank you.

160
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:31,000
Thank you, Your Highness.

161
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,080
I'll take my leave.

162
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:38,640
Your Highness.

163
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,160
I have a feeling

164
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,560
that Consort Qi is up to no good.

165
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:48,200
She always leans on the late Empress.

166
00:06:49,080 --> 00:06:51,600
The tenth memorial is a perfect chance.

167
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,520
Why would she hand it to me?

168
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:56,160
She must have planned everything,

169
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:58,600
waiting for us to walk into her trap.

170
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,320
What should we do, then?

171
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:03,080
We can't just sit here and wait.

172
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:07,040
Since she's handed us
such a good chance,

173
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:09,720
we'll use the late Empress's
tenth memorial

174
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:12,760
to strip her of that protection
for good.

175
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:23,760
Your Highness.

176
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:25,600
Hurry.

177
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,280
Put the lovers' knot in place.

178
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,600
Yes.

179
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,160
How did this happen?

180
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:36,640
We didn't expect

181
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:38,720
the Imperial Household
would send the knot early.

182
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,240
We didn't inspect it carefully.

183
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:42,280
Now if we say it was already broken

184
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,120
when it arrived,

185
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,600
there's no evidence left.

186
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:46,720
Such a simple trick,

187
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:48,680
and we still fell for it.

188
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,640
What do we do, Your Highness?

189
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,440
The memorial is about to begin.

190
00:07:58,760 --> 00:07:59,560
Yes.

191
00:08:06,089 --> 00:08:08,546
(Empress Yang's Tablet, Xiaocheng
Renduan Shuhui Anjing Xianyi Zhuanghe)

192
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,040
Son.

193
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:17,480
Today is the late Empress's
memorial day.

194
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:20,040
How is it that you have time
to come to me?

195
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,280
Mother...

196
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:23,080
There's something I can't decide.

197
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:24,880
I'd like your advice.

198
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,320
What's troubling you?

199
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,000
Tell me.

200
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,840
The princesses in the harem

201
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,280
are growing up.

202
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,160
The ministers and the vassal kings
of the court

203
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,840
as well as the tributary states

204
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:40,320
are all awaiting my favor.

205
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,520
I understand.

206
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,920
You're having trouble deciding

207
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:48,960
which princess to send
for a marriage alliance.

208
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,120
Right?

209
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:51,200
Yes.

210
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,120
Sending a princess

211
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:54,880
to a foreign land

212
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,440
thousands of miles away,

213
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,760
parted from my flesh and blood.

214
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,760
Away from me,

215
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:02,480
who will comfort her when she's wronged?

216
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:04,920
Who will care for her when she's ill?

217
00:09:05,880 --> 00:09:07,080
They're all my daughters.

218
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:09,120
Whoever I send,

219
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,360
my heart can't bear it.

220
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:13,240
My son.

221
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:18,040
I can't decide for you
which princess to send away.

222
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:20,000
But I know well

223
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:22,000
that being a good emperor

224
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:23,600
is no easy task.

225
00:09:23,960 --> 00:09:26,480
You must endure what others cannot,

226
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:30,080
and bear hardships beyond their reach.

227
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:33,640
The realm is in your hands.

228
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,200
From then on,

229
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:38,120
you have no right to tender feelings.

230
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:42,120
Nor can you always be a loving father.

231
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:45,480
Even daughters from ordinary families

232
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:48,400
must marry into a family
of matching status

233
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,000
to trade for some advantage,

234
00:09:50,640 --> 00:09:51,800
or to win imperial favor,

235
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,720
and bring honor to their clan.

236
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:58,680
The princesses are all precious jewels.

237
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,600
Born noble,

238
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:03,680
and pampered from childhood.

239
00:10:04,200 --> 00:10:06,200
They're taught music, chess,
calligraphy and painting,

240
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,400
and proper conduct.

241
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,240
And for what?

242
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,280
So that one day,

243
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:13,880
when they're married off as rewards,

244
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:18,040
they'll be worth more
as bargaining chips.

245
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:19,920
In the end,

246
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:21,600
all women,

247
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:24,520
no matter how wealthy their families,

248
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:25,960
are all the same.

249
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:29,160
They're destined to be bargaining chips.

250
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:31,160
Their lives aren't their own.

251
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:32,680
No one

252
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:35,760
can truly control their own fate.

253
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:37,840
Indeed.

254
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:40,720
I...

255
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:41,840
understand.

256
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,840
The auspicious hour has arrived.

257
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:51,440
Your Majesty,
please offer incense and pray.

258
00:11:00,537 --> 00:11:02,160
(Empress Yang's Tablet, Xiaocheng
Renduan Shuhui Anjing Xianyi Zhuanghe)

259
00:11:11,170 --> 00:11:12,119
(Empress Yang's Tablet, Xiaocheng
Renduan Shuhui Anjing Xianyi Zhuanghe)

260
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,200
It's been ten years.

261
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:15,360
I've never stopped thinking of you.

262
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:17,440
I hope your spirit in heaven

263
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,240
can feel my longing.

264
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,280
Don't be disappointed in me.

265
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:29,280
All consorts, please offer incense
and pray for the Empress.

266
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,600
On such a grand day,

267
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:41,240
the lovers' knot from His Majesty
and the late Empress

268
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,400
is still in its box.

269
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:43,520
Not even displayed.

270
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:44,840
It's my oversight.

271
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:46,880
Once Your Highness has offered incense,

272
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,400
I'll put it on display.

273
00:11:51,557 --> 00:11:53,680
(Empress Yang's Tablet, Xiaocheng
Renduan Shuhui Anjing Xianyi Zhuanghe)

274
00:12:00,357 --> 00:12:01,637
(Empress Yang's Tablet, Xiaocheng
Renduan Shuhui Anjing Xianyi Zhuanghe)

275
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,840
The lamp oil spilled!

276
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,000
It's on fire!

277
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:13,320
What do we do?

278
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:24,560
The token from His Majesty
and the late Empress is ruined...

279
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,520
What are we going to do?

280
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:32,280
Now if we say it was already broken

281
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:33,120
when it arrived,

282
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,360
there's already no evidence.

283
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:39,800
Prepare a few incense sticks
dipped in pine oil.

284
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:42,120
Have someone hand them to
Consort Qi specially.

285
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:44,440
Mix phosphorus into the lotus lamp oil
on the altar.

286
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:45,680
Once the oil spills,

287
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:46,760
it'll start a fire.

288
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:48,200
Yes.

289
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:52,400
(That wretch)

290
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,280
(slipped away again!)

291
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:08,800
This was the token of my love
for the late Empress.

292
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,800
It's the only keepsake she left me!

293
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:12,480
How could you be so careless?

294
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:16,200
Please calm down, Your Majesty!

295
00:13:16,960 --> 00:13:18,480
What do we do now?

296
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:19,840
Shh! Keep your voice down.

297
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,360
This is going to be bad.

298
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:22,480
Consort Rong.

299
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:25,120
I entrusted you with the memorial

300
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,320
and the lovers' knot to your care.

301
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,600
How could you be so negligent?

302
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:29,600
I would never, Your Majesty.

303
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:30,720
Please hear me out.

304
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:33,480
I hold the late Empress
in the highest regard.

305
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:34,640
I'd never disrespect her.

306
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:36,320
I've cared for her belongings

307
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,720
with the utmost attention,

308
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:38,560
never leaving them unattended.

309
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:39,720
I would never neglect them.

310
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,000
Consort Qi!

311
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:42,480
Your Majesty.

312
00:13:42,680 --> 00:13:43,880
I was at fault, Your Majesty.

313
00:13:44,160 --> 00:13:45,560
Just now, my hand slipped.

314
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,320
I...

315
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:48,840
I never meant to destroy her belongings!

316
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:50,760
Before Your Majesty married the Empress,

317
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,120
she personally

318
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,800
tied this lovers' knot wholeheartedly.

319
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,120
This knot

320
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:57,760
witnessed your lifelong bond with her.

321
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,480
After she passed away,

322
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:00,720
custom dictated

323
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,280
that her personal belongings

324
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:03,080
be burned or

325
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:03,840
buried with her.

326
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:04,960
Nothing was kept.

327
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,560
Only this lovers' knot

328
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:09,360
was kept at His Majesty's word,
the only keepsake.

329
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,120
Bound as husband and wife,

330
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,760
one heart forever.

331
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:15,680
And now you've destroyed this knot.

332
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:16,800
Consort Qi.

333
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:19,280
What are you plotting?

334
00:14:22,222 --> 00:14:26,862
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

335
00:14:27,232 --> 00:14:31,712
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

336
00:14:32,142 --> 00:14:36,422
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

337
00:14:36,862 --> 00:14:41,342
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

338
00:14:41,782 --> 00:14:46,102
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

339
00:14:46,682 --> 00:14:51,142
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

340
00:14:51,482 --> 00:14:55,942
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

341
00:14:56,362 --> 00:15:00,862
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

342
00:15:01,152 --> 00:15:05,622
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

343
00:15:06,202 --> 00:15:09,200
♪Let the stars and sea♪

344
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,680
(Changsheng Gate)

345
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:13,112
♪Wait for your return♪
